OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FNeil and Mary welcome their rivals
OL,7,     Fto Fernie Castle in Fife. There's
OL,8,     Fplenty of traditional Scots
OL,9,     Fsplendour on show, but two guests
OL,10,     Faren't impressed by the
OL,11,     Fcontinental breakfast.
OL,12,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe last visit of the week is to
OL,14,     Fthe Cadillac Kustomz Hotel on the
OL,15,     FIsle of Bute, where owners Brody
OL,16,     Fand Rima hope to rock their
OL,17,     Fguests' worlds with a music-filled
OL,18,     Fretro retreat.
