OL,5,G2025 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FOn payment day, there are curtain
OL,7,     Fcomplaints and breakfast blues as
OL,8,     Fthe B&Bers iron out their issues,
OL,9,     Fbefore they find out how much
OL,10,     Fthey've been paid and who's won
OL,11,     Fthe week.
