OL,5,G2200 Paramedics
OL,6,     FBrand new series: Matt treats a
OL,7,     Fman who's suffered serious facial
OL,8,     Fburns at work. An 85-year-old
OL,9,     Fwoman is struggling to breathe.
OL,10,     FAnd Mark deals with a difficult
OL,11,     Fpatient.
OL,12,G2300 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FIn Hartlepool, the heli-medics
OL,14,     Ftreat a man who's been hit by a
OL,15,     Ftrain. Cyclist Trevor suffers
OL,16,     Fserious injuries after a
OL,17,     Fcollision. And in Cumbria, a biker
OL,18,     Fneeds emergency surgery.
